diff --git a/changelog/2577.bugfix.rst b/changelog/2577.bugfix.rst
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..6d86f98c
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/2577.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+Fixed HTTPS proxies in forwarding mode (``use_forwarding_for_https=True``) using the
+origin's ``ssl_context``, ``assert_hostname`` and ``assert_fingerprint`` to connect to
+the proxy. The proxy's own TLS configuration (``proxy_ssl_context``,
+``proxy_assert_hostname``, ``proxy_assert_fingerprint``) is now used instead, matching
+tunneling mode. If no ``proxy_ssl_context`` is given, forwarding mode still falls back
+to ``ssl_context`` for backwards compatibility.
